title: dumpster
tags:
---
<<if IsObjectiveActive("Q_0P_NEVER_TRUST_WHITE_VAN","O_0P_WHITE_VAN_GET_RID_OF_BODIES") == true>>
    <<CompleteObjective "Q_0P_NEVER_TRUST_WHITE_VAN" "O_0P_WHITE_VAN_GET_RID_OF_BODIES">>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][One by one, you heave the bodies into the dumpster. There's a soft thud as they hit the metal.][/nomarkup] #line:08438ac
    -> {$pcName}: Won't these be found? #line:0bffeae
        {$kieran}: We have a lot of drop points like this across the city. See that logo? 
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He points to a faded picture on the side of a dumpster. It looks like it belongs to Ardus Enterprises.][/nomarkup]
        {$kieran}: You can dispose of bodies in dumpsters with it. No questions asked. #line:06df308
        <<jump financeRoll>>
<<else>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][An old, weathered dumpster with the Ardus Enterprises logo on it. You're not sure if it's blood or rust lining the sides.][/nomarkup] #line:02aad1b
    -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
<<endif>>
===
title: financeRoll
---
<<if (Roll("Intelligence","Streetwise") >= 3) or (Roll("Intelligence","Finance") >= 3)>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Ardus Enterprises is a large trash processing company that cleans most of Vegas's districts. These days, they also push hard for the Yucca Mountain Nuclear Waste Repository.][/nomarkup]
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][In the past, you heard, and even investigated, some stories about bodies found in the dumpsters. Even in smaller containers next to private houses...][/nomarkup] #line:024628d
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You can't help but wonder how many of those corpses were created due to vampiric influence in the city.][/nomarkup]
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Do the Kindred have some kind of connection to Ardus? Did they strike a mutual agreement?][/nomarkup]
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The questions are piling up one after another - just like the bodies you throw into a dumpster's hungry maw to most likely never be seen again.][/nomarkup] #line:04b6459
    -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
<<else>>
    -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
<<endif>>
===
